							<td width="75%" align="left">
								&nbsp;<a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php#1">MASS LINE FORUMS</a> / <a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?board=1.0">Mass Line Artist Discussion</a> / <a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?topic=2653.msg31310#msg31310">misguided myspace message of the day!</a>
							</td>
							<td align="right" style="padding: 0 1ex; white-space: nowrap;">
								on: June 15, 2007, 01:21:45 pm
							</td>
