							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">Peace Jose. For real tho, we stepped out of the van after a 6 hour drive from LA and the first thing we see is a bunch of cats greeting us and showing us love at the venue waiting since 7pm (it was around 830-9). Right when it was needed most on the last few days of the tour. Yo Chris - can we get an upload of some of that video footage? All respect also goes out to the homie Rudy at the SoMa Rec Center for opening up the space on Friday and sista Rach (Bayan-USA up!) for the hookup. Also peace to Orko (formerly the Sycotik Alien) for rollin up with us to the Bay and setting the show off properly! And my brotha Kiwi for hosting! Peace Jose - let the whole East Bay fam know we got their back, and thanks for having hours. One! geo</td>
